Room Management System - Backend

About

This project is a backend application developed using Java and Spring Boot to manage room information.

Technologies Used

* Java
* Spring Boot
* Maven
* REST API

Room Details

The application manages room information such as:

* Room name
* Location
* Room type
* Price per night
* Capacity
* Availability
* Room number

Project Structure

* DemoApplication.java - Main application
* Room.java - Room model
* RoomController.java - Handles API requests
* application.properties - Application configuration

